#### 3.5 跟单执行流程

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Signal as 信号源
    participant MW as C++ Middleware
    participant Engine as Copy Engine
    participant Subs as Subscriptions
    participant Trade as Trading Service

    Signal->>MW: 开仓交易
    MW->>Engine: 推送交易事件
    Engine->>Subs: 获取所有订阅者

    loop 每个订阅者（并行）
        Engine->>Engine: 预检查
        alt 通过预检查
            Engine->>Trade: 执行跟单
            Trade->>MW: 发送订单
            MW-->>Trade: 返回结果
            Trade-->>Engine: 跟单结果
        else 未通过预检查
            Engine->>Engine: 记录失败原因
        end
    end

    Engine->>Engine: 更新跟单状态
    Engine->>Engine: WebSocket 推送
```

#### 3.6 SettlementsModule

```typescript
// src/settlements/settlement.service.ts
interface SettlementService {
  // 触发结算
  triggerSettlement(providerId: string, period: SettlementPeriod): Promise<Settlement>;

  // 计算分成（高水位线法）
  calculateProfitShare(
    subscription: Subscription,
    period: SettlementPeriod,
  ): Promise<ProfitShareResult>;

  // 获取结算历史
  getSettlementHistory(providerId: string, query: QueryDto): Promise<Settlement[]>;
}

interface ProfitShareResult {
  grossProfit: number;           // 总盈利
  highWaterMark: number;         // 高水位线
  shareableProfit: number;       // 可分成利润
  profitShareAmount: number;     // 信号源分成
  netProfit: number;             // 跟单者净利润
}

type SettlementPeriod = 'DAILY' | 'WEEKLY' | 'MONTHLY';
```

#### 3.7 高水位线计算

```typescript
// src/settlements/profit-calculator.service.ts
class ProfitCalculator {
  /**
   * 高水位线法计算分成
   *
   * 逻辑：只对超过历史最高点的新盈利部分收取分成
   *
   * 示例：
   * - 上周高水位: $10,000
   * - 本周收益: $12,000
   * - 可分成利润: $2,000
   * - 分成比例: 20%
   * - 信号源分成: $400
   */
  calculate(
    currentEquity: number,
    highWaterMark: number,
    profitSharePercent: number,
  ): ProfitShareResult {
    const grossProfit = currentEquity - highWaterMark;

    if (grossProfit <= 0) {
      return {
        grossProfit: 0,
        highWaterMark,
        shareableProfit: 0,
        profitShareAmount: 0,
        netProfit: 0,
      };
    }

    const profitShareAmount = grossProfit * (profitSharePercent / 100);
    const netProfit = grossProfit - profitShareAmount;

    return {
      grossProfit,
      highWaterMark: currentEquity, // 更新高水位
      shareableProfit: grossProfit,
      profitShareAmount,
      netProfit,
    };
  }
}
```

