### 错误处理策略

| 场景 | HTTP Status | 处理方式 |
|------|-------------|---------|
| Token 无效/过期 | 401 | 返回错误，客户端重新登录 |
| 租户不存在 | 404 | 返回 404（不泄露存在性） |
| 租户被禁用 | 403 | 返回 Forbidden |
| 跨租户访问 | 404 | 返回 404（不泄露存在性） |
| 超过限流 | 429 | 返回 Retry-After 头部 |
| 跟单失败-余额不足 | 200 | 返回成功，状态为 FAILED |
| 跟单失败-网络超时 | 200 | 返回成功，状态为 RETRY |
| 中间件不可用 | 503 | 返回 Service Unavailable |

### 跟单重试策略

```typescript
// src/copy-engine/retry-handler.service.ts
class RetryHandler {
  private readonly MAX_RETRIES = 3;
  private readonly BASE_DELAY = 100; // ms

  async executeWithRetry<T>(
    operation: () => Promise<T>,
    context: CopyTradeContext,
  ): Promise<RetryResult<T>> {
    for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= this.MAX_RETRIES; attempt++) {
      try {
        const result = await operation();
        return { success: true, result, attempts: attempt };
      } catch (error) {
        if (!this.isRetryable(error)) {
          return { success: false, error, attempts: attempt };
        }

        if (attempt < this.MAX_RETRIES) {
          const delay = this.BASE_DELAY * Math.pow(2, attempt - 1); // 指数退避
          await this.sleep(delay);
        }
      }
    }

    return { success: false, error: 'Max retries exceeded', attempts: this.MAX_RETRIES };
  }

  private isRetryable(error: any): boolean {
    // 只重试网络超时类错误
    return error.code === 'TIMEOUT' || error.code === 'NETWORK_ERROR';
  }
}
